{"vid":"USne6TBtIYg","source":"USne6TBtIYg.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":2.1,"txt":"What's up, Joel?"},{"t":2.9,"txt":"That young man in the baseball cap is"},{"t":4.9,"txt":"barely old enough to drink in Texas."},{"t":7,"txt":"How's the 5 and 6 going?"},{"t":8.9,"txt":"But every workday, Joel Poole checks"},{"t":10.8,"txt":"into a control room that looks like"},{"t":12.5,"txt":"something built by NASA."},{"t":14.3,"txt":"Any problems with the cat pumps?"},{"t":15.8,"txt":"This seemingly spotless workplace is a"},{"t":18.1,"txt":"nerve center for a 21st century"},{"t":20,"txt":"petrochemical plant."},{"t":21.3,"txt":"Just seeing firsthand how things are"},{"t":22.9,"txt":"made is something that I enjoy doing,"},{"t":25.8,"txt":"and seeing it from gas to plastic is is"},{"t":28.3,"txt":"a really interesting experience."},{"t":30,"txt":"His hot and noisy job keeps him on his"},{"t":32.4,"txt":"feet at the Chevron Phillips Chemical"},{"t":34.3,"txt":"Plant in Baytown, Texas, just east of"},{"t":36.4,"txt":"Houston. Here they make stuff like the"},{"t":38.3,"txt":"plastics we find in everything from milk"},{"t":40.4,"txt":"jugs to bicycle helmets. You might think"},{"t":42.8,"txt":"a plant like this would be crowded with"},{"t":44.7,"txt":"workers, but it's mostly automated."},{"t":46.9,"txt":"Do you know where your assembly sites"},{"t":48,"txt":"are?"},{"t":48.5,"txt":"Joel Poole monitors the refining"},{"t":50.1,"txt":"process, a job that requires only 2"},{"t":52.2,"txt":"years of college. It's also one of those"},{"t":54.6,"txt":"middle-skilled jobs that petrochemical"},{"t":56.8,"txt":"industry now has a tough time filling."},{"t":59.2,"txt":"This country is facing a shortage of"},{"t":60.8,"txt":"that kind of talent. So, the the demand"},{"t":63,"txt":"is there big-time. What we need to work"},{"t":65.5,"txt":"on is the supply."},{"t":66.7,"txt":"We're going to need to do a gas test"},{"t":68.4,"txt":"around the motor."},{"t":69.4,"txt":"Poole's a third-generation refinery"},{"t":71.5,"txt":"worker who just started this job a few"},{"t":73.2,"txt":"months ago, but even he's noticing how"},{"t":75.3,"txt":"many of his coworkers are approaching"},{"t":77.1,"txt":"retirement age."},{"t":78.4,"txt":"There's a gap now. There's the people"},{"t":80.8,"txt":"that have been here 40 years, and then"},{"t":82.2,"txt":"there's the people like me that have"},{"t":83.3,"txt":"been here just over a year. And so,"},{"t":85.9,"txt":"we're That's why we're trying to get"},{"t":87.1,"txt":"more people to fill in these jobs so we"},{"t":89.3,"txt":"can kind of bridge the gap."},{"t":91.1,"txt":"He's only 21 years old, but he's already"},{"t":93.7,"txt":"on track to make more than $100,000"},{"t":96.9,"txt":"in his first year out of college, and"},{"t":98.8,"txt":"the petrochemical industry is anxiously"},{"t":101.1,"txt":"looking for more workers like him. In"},{"t":103.5,"txt":"Houston, Doug Miller for USA Today."}],"words":[{"t":2.12,"w":"What's"},{"t":2.2,"w":"up,"},{"t":2.44,"w":"Joel?"},{"t":2.92,"w":"That"},{"t":3.2,"w":"young"},{"t":3.4,"w":"man"},{"t":3.64,"w":"in"},{"t":3.72,"w":"the"},{"t":3.8,"w":"baseball"},{"t":4.36,"w":"cap"},{"t":4.68,"w":"is"},{"t":4.88,"w":"barely"},{"t":5.32,"w":"old"},{"t":5.48,"w":"enough"},{"t":5.68,"w":"to"},{"t":5.8,"w":"drink"},{"t":6.16,"w":"in"},{"t":6.32,"w":"Texas."},{"t":7,"w":"How's"},{"t":7.28,"w":"the"},{"t":7.92,"w":"5"},{"t":8.08,"w":"and"},{"t":8.2,"w":"6"},{"t":8.44,"w":"going?"},{"t":8.92,"w":"But"},{"t":9.08,"w":"every"},{"t":9.32,"w":"workday,"},{"t":9.76,"w":"Joel"},{"t":10.12,"w":"Poole"},{"t":10.52,"w":"checks"},{"t":10.8,"w":"into"},{"t":11.04,"w":"a"},{"t":11.08,"w":"control"},{"t":11.64,"w":"room"},{"t":11.92,"w":"that"},{"t":12.12,"w":"looks"},{"t":12.32,"w":"like"},{"t":12.52,"w":"something"},{"t":12.88,"w":"built"},{"t":13.12,"w":"by"},{"t":13.24,"w":"NASA."},{"t":14.28,"w":"Any"},{"t":14.44,"w":"problems"},{"t":14.76,"w":"with"},{"t":14.92,"w":"the"},{"t":15,"w":"cat"